  24               	/****
  25               	 * d0 always contains the return parameter from pgmld
  26               	 * d1 is the return register from local subroutines
  27               	 * a0 contains the pointer to the Load Parm Block passed to pgmld
  28               	
  29               	 * Return parameters in d0 are --
  30               	 *       00 - function successful
  31               	 *       01 - insufficient memory or bad header in file
  32               	 *       02 - read error on file
  33               	 *       03 - bad relocation information in file
  34               	
  35               	 * Entry point for Program Load routine	
  36               							***/
